     5523   input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     5524   run fltfield-add in this-procedure('host-code', '', '',
     5525   input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     5526   run fltfield-add in this-procedure('corr-date', '', '',
     5527   input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     5528   run fltfield-add in this-procedure('corr-time', 'Время корр.', 'time',
     5529   input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     5530   run fltfield-add in this-procedure('corr-user-db-num', '', '',
     5531   input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
