     5533   input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     5534   run fltfield-add in this-procedure('subject', 'Предмет изменения', 'cli-hist-subject',
     5535   input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     5536   run fltfield-add in this-procedure('action', 'Действие', 'hist-action',
     5537   input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     5538   Filter-Block:
     5539   DO ON STOP    UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block
     5540       ON ERROR   UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block
     5541       ON END-KEY UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block :
